{
 "_captured": "Captured verbatim from the property values of three pluggable widgets and one microflow action of two starter app models (ids as hex, module names renamed to Shop, each widget trimmed to the properties named): widgets[0] an Image widget (Image value, a no-action Action, a primitive), widgets[1] a Language selector (an XPath DataSource with its entity, an Expression), widgets[2] a Data grid drop-down filter (an object list of two items). flows.microflow_action is a page's Forms$MicroflowAction as the model holds it; no widget of those models has a microflow datasource or a microflow action, so the controls splice that real action (and its Forms$MicroflowSettings) into a captured widget's Action or DataSource. The wrapper type name of a microflow datasource is NOT captured: the reader looks for the flow field only.",
